<title>FRANCE: FRANCE EXPELS ROMANIAN ILLEGAL IMMIGRANTS.</title>
<headline>FRANCE EXPELS ROMANIAN ILLEGAL IMMIGRANTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>A chartered Romanian airliner on Tuesday flew home 51 Romanians expelled from France for lack of a residence permit or disturbing the peace, the French Interior Ministry said.</p>
<p>It was the 23rd such group expulsion since the centre-right government took office 19 months ago, pledging a crackdown on clandestine immigration, the ministry said. More than 20,000 illegal immigrants have been expelled during that period.</p>
